Please note that lockfile.man in this directory still needs to be converted
into its lockfile.1 counterpart.  You can convert it by typing "make" in
this directory or in the directory above.

lockfile.1 can then be displayed as readable plain text
by typing something like this:

	nroff -man lockfile.1

or they can be moved to man directories in your MANPATH to be be viewed with
the normal man command.
